{"page":38,"width":1986,"height":2532,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"과목 1 데이터 모텔령의 이해","words":[{"text":"과목","x":170,"y":82,"width":66,"height":31},{"text":"1","x":265,"y":82,"width":15,"height":29},{"text":"데이터","x":308,"y":81,"width":94,"height":32},{"text":"모텔령의","x":422,"y":83,"width":121,"height":32},{"text":"이해","x":563,"y":82,"width":60,"height":31}]},{"text":"마. 속성케 포함","words":[{"text":"마.","x":176,"y":237,"width":45,"height":36},{"text":"속성케","x":241,"y":236,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"포함","x":328,"y":235,"width":69,"height":35}]},{"text":"다것 번지는 언터티에는 반드시 속성(Atüibutes)이 포함되어야 한다는 점이다. 속성을 포함하지 않고 엔터티의","words":[{"text":"다것","x":223,"y":315,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"번지는","x":303,"y":314,"width":99,"height":33},{"text":"언터티에는","x":413,"y":313,"width":163,"height":33},{"text":"반드시","x":589,"y":313,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"속성(Atüibutes)이","x":696,"y":313,"width":269,"height":38},{"text":"포함되어야","x":980,"y":313,"width":155,"height":36},{"text":"한다는","x":1146,"y":314,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"점이다.","x":1250,"y":314,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"속성을","x":1360,"y":312,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"포함하지","x":1463,"y":312,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"않고","x":1598,"y":313,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"엔터티의","x":1673,"y":313,"width":121,"height":34}]},{"text":"이름만 갖고 있는 경우는 관계가 생략되어 있거나 업무 분석이 미진하여 속성정보가 누락되는 경우에 해당한다","words":[{"text":"이름만","x":180,"y":368,"width":102,"height":33},{"text":"갖고","x":298,"y":368,"width":66,"height":32},{"text":"있는","x":378,"y":366,"width":67,"height":33},{"text":"경우는","x":462,"y":367,"width":96,"height":33},{"text":"관계가","x":571,"y":367,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"생략되어","x":684,"y":368,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"있거나","x":824,"y":367,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"업무","x":934,"y":368,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"분석이","x":1010,"y":368,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"미진하여","x":1117,"y":369,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"속성정보가","x":1251,"y":366,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"누락되는","x":1417,"y":366,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"경우에","x":1555,"y":367,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"해당한다","x":1662,"y":368,"width":127,"height":34}]},{"text":"또한 주식별자만 존재하고 일반속성은 전혀 없는 경우도 마찬가지로 적절한 엔터티라고 할 수 없다. 단 예외적으로","words":[{"text":"또한","x":180,"y":421,"width":69,"height":33},{"text":"주식별자만","x":260,"y":419,"width":166,"height":35},{"text":"존재하고","x":437,"y":421,"width":130,"height":32},{"text":"일반속성은","x":579,"y":421,"width":157,"height":34},{"text":"전혀","x":750,"y":421,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"없는","x":824,"y":421,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"경우도","x":900,"y":422,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"마찬가지로","x":1004,"y":423,"width":152,"height":34},{"text":"적절한","x":1169,"y":422,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"엔터티라고","x":1269,"y":421,"width":150,"height":35},{"text":"할","x":1430,"y":420,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1472,"y":422,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"없다.","x":1518,"y":421,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"단","x":1601,"y":422,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"예외적으로","x":1643,"y":421,"width":155,"height":35}]},{"text":"관계 언터디(꼬-ati`℃ Entity)는 주식별자 속성만 가지고 있어도 엔터티로 인정한다.","words":[{"text":"관계","x":180,"y":475,"width":67,"height":33},{"text":"언터디(꼬-ati`℃","x":266,"y":474,"width":294,"height":36},{"text":"Entity)는","x":577,"y":478,"width":140,"height":37},{"text":"주식별자","x":733,"y":475,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"속성만","x":876,"y":477,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"가지고","x":987,"y":478,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"있어도","x":1096,"y":477,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"엔터티로","x":1203,"y":476,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"인정한다.","x":1341,"y":475,"width":129,"height":35}]},{"text":"대풍","words":[{"text":"대풍","x":465,"y":597,"width":57,"height":28}]},{"text":"날씨","words":[{"text":"날씨","x":1002,"y":625,"width":52,"height":29}]},{"text":"엔터티","words":[{"text":"엔터티","x":1402,"y":641,"width":82,"height":31}]},{"text":"속성이 존재하지 않는 오브젝트는 엔터티가 월 수 없음","words":[{"text":"속성이","x":642,"y":816,"width":85,"height":31},{"tex